# Source 2: Docker Hub, https://hub.docker.com/v2/repositories/kindest/node/tags/v1.37.0 (read 2026-11-10):
#   index digest sha256:a1ed56cf...580ae5 (same), pushed 2026-08-26T21:11:14Z;
