#                 linux/amd64 sha256:1aac8018c42eb5d48fae5be507caaee789fc6d9b9b3f560359dd4157ac00d4f6.
# Why 1.37: the target's go.mod at v0.1.2 uses k8s.io/client-go v0.37.1, i.e. the Kubernetes 1.37 client.
#   Kubernetes 1.37 is the newest minor (latest patch v1.37.2, 2026-10-28); 1.35-1.37 are in support.
# Known gap: kind v0.33.0 ships a 1.37.0 node image, two patch releases behind 1.37.2. No newer kindest/node tag
