#   (`kind build node-image`) is possible but makes outside reproduction harder; owner decision (PLAN.md).
# Other images in the same release: v1.36.4 sha256:099e049362a1526b2db71494e1947aae99bd16290d7c895f2b7ea312e3cbfaed,
#   v1.35.8 sha256:07b2536e30b803ed61d1677a79df6115f798ce64c80f9e22f6ed45afd09323c0,
